      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DO RUN BANDI (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (20.49) last time in a Mix 2/3 at Grafton. Solid record at the distance winning three races. The form out of his last race has been franked. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. GREAT MARLOW (8) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a one length second (17.36) in a Mix 3/4 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. SYMI SURTEE (2) produced a modest effort most recently when eighth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Good Odds Cuba (18.45) in a Grade 5. Cannot be taken lightly. MISS MOLIK (3) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
